## Security and isolation

- Browser measurement runs with JavaScript disabled.
- Source scripts, inline handlers, and `javascript:` URLs are removed from the bundle.
- Critical stylesheet load failures fail closed.
- ZIP traversal paths are rejected and extraction is confined to a random temporary workspace under `storage/app/pagebuilder-v24-compiled-native`.
- Analysis is read-only with no `Page_Builder::create`, `DB::`, Canvas replacement, or public save call in the analysis method. The Canvas mutation exists only behind the explicit client-side Apply action after target validation; it marks the editor dirty and tells the user to click Save.
- Static isolation tests found no v2.3 reference in the new Compiled Native classes or analysis route.

